Z||000001||skitime||06-24-2001||06:16 PM||||Get a hold of the factory repair manual from Helms.  <A HREF="http://www.helm.com/" TARGET=_blank>http://www.helm.com/</A>   You are a bright guy and will do fine with the right instructions.  You can always post questions on the forum and don't forget to do a search of the forum first.  And welcome to the forum. <P>------------------<BR><UL TYPE=SQUARE><BR><LI>Red 88 GT T-TOP<BR><LI>Red 86 GT<BR></UL><BR>      <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/pictures-1_5.jpg"> ||||reg||1
